; The `@`-prefixed debug console. Emuera diverts an answered input line that
; starts with `@` to `doSystemCommand` *without* consuming the pending request,
; so the same prompt comes back once the command has run
; (GameView/EmueraConsole.cs:1103-1110, :1321-1390).
;
; Four of the five wiki commands need no debug mode at all — only `@DEBUG` is
; gated on `-Debug`, and only the generic fall-through is gated on
; `デバッグコマンドを使用する` (:1367-1386). This fixture is therefore *not*
; marked `.debug`, and every line below is answered by one line of
; `debug_console.in`:
;
;   `@`         nothing after the sigil: returns before the echo (:1339-1341)
;   `@REBOO`    not a whole-string match, so the generic path, gate shut
;   `@DEBUG`    refused: this run has no -Debug
;   `@OUTPUT`   writes the console to <WorkingDir>/emuera.log and says so
;   `plain`     an ordinary answer, which finally satisfies the INPUTS
@SYSTEM_TITLE
PRINTL START
INPUTS
PRINTFORML [%RESULTS%]
